r.com/tDpM2dp\nKFPロゴとKFPチキン社員リファレンス\nhttps://imgur.com/VZ93H8n", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@s_kanae_sy/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d32f88f2/uploads/origins/721151a4-bbfd-4c18-895e-39f33bff0260?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93f800be4837558cb30ff7007624cdf2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d32f88f2/uploads/origins/721151a4-bbfd-4c18-895e-39f33bff0260?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93f800be4837558cb30ff7007624cdf2, https://si.imgix.net/d32f88f2/uploads/origins/721151a4-bbfd-4c18-895e-39f33bff0260?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6cae0a598dbb791ed1cb79effacf1c8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d32f88f2/uploads/origins/721151a4-bbfd-4c18-895e-39f33bff0260?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d22c9ea42c8b7f74683c86bac14d277 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Please draw this sea serpent girl character giving an aggressively hungry look at the viewer.  The setting should be underwater.  Please choose whichever set of character attire from the reference you are more comfortable with.  The sea serpent is 21 meters long.  The background of the image should include a single skeleton if possible.  Please include a version with a transparent background.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/3Hk8m4B", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@s_kanae_sy/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f68014fe/uploads/origins/be7094be-197e-4c55-8a99-37be8fb74c8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a04e19c97f98b3279d54fcc8285290a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f68014fe/uploads/origins/be7094be-197e-4c55-8a99-37be8fb74c8f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a04e19c97f98b3279d54fcc8285290a, https://si.imgix.net/f68014fe/uploads/origins/be7094be-197e-4c55-8a99-37be8fb74c8f?